{"id":"u161","kelas":"toefl","no":6,"judul":"Kosakata Akademik TOEFL","title":"TOEFL Academic Vocabulary","emoji":"📘","ringkas":"Kosakata penting untuk teks akademik","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari **kosakata akademik** yang sering muncul di TOEFL","memahami arti dan **contoh pemakaian** tiap kata","mengenali kata melalui **arti, ejaan, dan pendengaran**","membaca teks akademik dengan lebih percaya diri"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Teks TOEFL memakai kosakata akademik. Pelajari kata-kata berikut beserta contoh kalimatnya, lalu cari kata yang sama di bacaan."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Kata akademik (1)","items":[{"en":"hypothesis","id":"hipotesis","ex":"The scientist tested her hypothesis."},{"en":"evidence","id":"bukti","ex":"There is strong evidence for this theory."},{"en":"theory","id":"teori","ex":"Darwin proposed a famous theory."},{"en":"significant","id":"bermakna / penting","ex":"There was a significant increase in sales."},{"en":"factor","id":"faktor","ex":"Climate is one factor in this change."},{"en":"source","id":"sumber","ex":"The river is the main source of water."},{"en":"method","id":"metode","ex":"This method is faster."},{"en":"trend","id":"tren / kecenderungan","ex":"A new trend is growing among young people."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Kata akademik (2)","items":[{"en":"estimate","id":"memperkirakan","ex":"Experts estimate that the population will double."},{"en":"indicate","id":"menunjukkan","ex":"The results indicate a clear pattern."},{"en":"assume","id":"menganggap / mengira","ex":"Many people assume that the earth is flat."},{"en":"require","id":"memerlukan","ex":"The job requires experience."},{"en":"rely on","id":"bergantung pada","ex":"Many farmers rely on rain."},{"en":"conclude","id":"menyimpulkan","ex":"The study concluded that sleep matters."},{"en":"contrast","id":"kontras / perbedaan","ex":"There is a strong contrast between the two cities."},{"en":"emphasise","id":"menekankan","ex":"The teacher emphasised the main points."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kata akademik (3)","items":[{"en":"ensure","id":"memastikan","ex":"Please ensure that the door is locked."},{"en":"obtain","id":"memperoleh","ex":"She obtained a scholarship."},{"en":"previous","id":"sebelumnya","ex":"The previous study had a smaller sample."},{"en":"primary","id":"utama","ex":"The primary goal is safety."},{"en":"potential","id":"potensi","ex":"The project has great potential."},{"en":"various","id":"berbagai","ex":"Various factors affect prices."},{"en":"analyse","id":"menganalisis","ex":"They analysed the data carefully."},{"en":"consequence","id":"akibat","ex":"Pollution has serious consequences."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Diskusi seminar","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"What is your hypothesis?","id":"Apa hipotesismu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Sleep is a significant factor in memory.","id":"Tidur adalah faktor penting dalam daya ingat."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"What evidence do you have?","id":"Bukti apa yang kamu punya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Various studies indicate a clear pattern.","id":"Berbagai studi menunjukkan pola yang jelas."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Saat membaca teks akademik, tandai kata dari daftar ini. Pengulangan dalam konteks nyata jauh lebih efektif daripada menghafal daftar."},{"t":"summary","items":["Kata akademik (1): [[hypothesis]], [[evidence]], [[theory]], [[significant]], [[factor]], [[source]].","Kata akademik (2): [[estimate]], [[indicate]], [[assume]], [[require]], [[rely on]], [[conclude]].","Kata akademik (3): [[ensure]], [[obtain]], [[previous]], [[primary]], [[potential]], [[various]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"hypothesis\"?","options":["hipotesis","memperoleh","tren / kecenderungan","sebelumnya"],"answer":0,"exp":"hypothesis = hipotesis.","k":"fb025a21"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"hipotesis\" adalah...","options":["hypothesis","method","estimate","various"],"answer":0,"exp":"hipotesis = hypothesis.","k":"feae1ba0"},{"type":"fill